{"id":"vd-a2-the-library-ghost","level":"a2","n":19,"title":{"en":"Are You Scared of Ghosts?","vi":"Cậu có sợ ma không?"},"summary":"Trời tối dần trong thư viện; Zoe và Arjun ngồi chờ \"hồn ma\" và thú nhận với nhau mình sợ nhất điều gì.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-library-ghost","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Library Ghost","vi":"Hồn ma thư viện"}},"scene":{"background":"library","props":[{"id":"book","x":800}]},"cast":{"zoe":{"name":{"en":"Zoe","vi":"Zoe"},"look":"teengirl","x":500,"style":{"hair":"bob","hairColor":"#B5652E","glasses":true,"outfit":"uniform","top":"#3A8E8B","topShade":"#2D7673"}},"arjun":{"name":{"en":"Arjun","vi":"Arjun"},"look":"teenboy","x":1120,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#B07650","skinShade":"#94603E","outfit":"uniform","top":"#3A8E8B","topShade":"#2D7673"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"arjun","en":"Zoe, it's getting dark.","vi":"Zoe, trời bắt đầu tối rồi.","ipa":["ˈzoʊi","ɪts","ˈɡɛtɪŋ","dɑɹk"],"start":0.554,"end":1.984,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.994],[2,1.184],[3,1.511]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"I know. The ghost comes after five, remember?","vi":"Tớ biết. Con ma đến sau năm giờ, nhớ không?","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","ðə","ɡoʊst","kʌmz","ˈæftɚ","faɪv","ɹɪˈmɛmbɚ"],"start":2.774,"end":5.864,"expression":"happy","visual":{"lights":"off","fade":4},"timing":[[0,2.774],[1,2.813],[2,3.615],[3,3.71],[4,4.118],[5,4.43],[6,4.77],[7,5.327]]},{"speaker":"arjun","en":"Half the class is too frightened to come here now.","vi":"Nửa lớp giờ sợ quá chẳng dám đến đây nữa.","ipa":["hæf","ðə","klæs","ɪz","tu","ˈfɹaɪtənd","tu","kʌm","hiɹ","naʊ"],"start":6.654,"end":9.444,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,6.654],[1,6.966],[2,7.075],[3,7.537],[4,7.74],[5,7.971],[6,8.447],[7,8.556],[8,8.787],[9,9.045]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"Good. I love a mystery.","vi":"Càng tốt. Tớ mê những chuyện bí ẩn mà.","ipa":["ɡʊd","aɪ","lʌv","ə","ˈmɪstɚi"],"start":10.234,"end":11.984,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,10.234],[1,10.936],[2,11.004],[3,11.249],[4,11.33]]},{"speaker":"arjun","en":"Are you scared of ghosts?","vi":"Cậu có sợ ma không?","ipa":["ɑɹ","ju","skɛɹd","ʌv","ɡoʊsts"],"start":12.774,"end":14.124,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,12.774],[1,12.841],[2,12.963],[3,13.398],[4,13.534]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"No. Ghosts don't exist. I'm not scared of ghosts.","vi":"Không. Ma làm gì có thật. Tớ không sợ ma.","ipa":["noʊ","ɡoʊsts","doʊnt","ɪɡˈzɪst","aɪm","nɑt","skɛɹd","ʌv","ɡoʊsts"],"start":14.914,"end":19.074,"gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,14.914],[1,15.66],[2,16],[3,16.271],[4,17.44],[5,17.576],[6,17.834],[7,18.242],[8,18.405]]},{"speaker":"arjun","en":"Then what are you afraid of?","vi":"Vậy cậu sợ cái gì?","ipa":["ðɛn","wʌt","ɑɹ","ju","əˈfɹeɪd","ʌv"],"start":19.864,"end":21.224,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,19.864],[1,20.094],[2,20.27],[3,20.352],[4,20.556],[5,21.045]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"Hmm… I'm afraid of spiders. And exams!","vi":"Ừm… Tớ sợ nhện. Với cả thi cử!","ipa":["hm","aɪm","əˈfɹeɪd","ʌv","ˈspaɪdɚz","ənd","ɪɡˈzæmz"],"start":22.014,"end":25.524,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,22.014],[1,22.648],[2,22.824],[3,23.218],[4,23.341],[5,24.563],[6,24.699]]},{"speaker":"arjun","en":"Exams? Don't be silly!","vi":"Thi cử á? Đừng nói linh tinh!","ipa":["ɪɡˈzæmz","doʊnt","bi","ˈsɪli"],"start":26.314,"end":28.364,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,26.314],[1,27.417],[2,27.648],[3,27.797]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"What about you? Are you scared of ghosts?","vi":"Còn cậu? Cậu có sợ ma không?","ipa":["wʌt","əˈbaʊt","ju","ɑɹ","ju","skɛɹd","ʌv","ɡoʊsts"],"start":29.154,"end":31.874,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,29.154],[1,29.265],[2,29.659],[3,30.406],[4,30.529],[5,30.692],[6,31.099],[7,31.249]]},{"speaker":"arjun","en":"Not really. But I'm scared of the dark.","vi":"Không hẳn. Nhưng tớ sợ bóng tối.","ipa":["nɑt","ˈɹɪli","bʌt","aɪm","skɛɹd","ʌv","ðə","dɑɹk"],"start":32.664,"end":35.314,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,32.664],[1,32.917],[2,33.8],[3,33.95],[4,34.099],[5,34.616],[6,34.724],[7,34.847]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"The dark? Why?","vi":"Bóng tối á? Sao vậy?","ipa":["ðə","dɑɹk","waɪ"],"start":36.104,"end":37.464,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,36.104],[1,36.188],[2,37.125]]},{"speaker":"arjun","en":"When I was small, I saw a big shadow in my room. I screamed.","vi":"Hồi nhỏ, tớ nhìn thấy một cái bóng to trong phòng. Tớ hét toáng lên.","ipa":["wɛn","aɪ","wɑz","smɔl","aɪ","sɔ","ə","bɪɡ","ˈʃæˌdoʊ","ɪn","maɪ","ɹum","aɪ","skɹimd"],"start":38.254,"end":42.514,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,38.254],[1,38.341],[2,38.437],[3,38.6],[4,39.428],[5,39.564],[6,39.85],[7,39.972],[8,40.189],[9,40.678],[10,40.787],[11,40.964],[12,41.792],[13,41.86]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"What was it?","vi":"Đó là cái gì?","ipa":["wʌt","wɑz","ɪt"],"start":43.304,"end":44.004,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,43.304],[1,43.442],[2,43.687]]},{"speaker":"arjun","en":"My coat on the door.","vi":"Cái áo khoác của tớ treo trên cửa.","ipa":["maɪ","koʊt","ɑn","ðə","dɔɹ"],"start":44.794,"end":46.074,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,44.794],[1,44.915],[2,45.309],[3,45.499],[4,45.622]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"Ha! You're braver than you think.","vi":"Ha! Cậu dũng cảm hơn cậu nghĩ đấy.","ipa":["hɑ","jʊɹ","ˈbɹeɪvɚ","ðæn","ju","θɪŋk"],"start":46.864,"end":49.024,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,46.864],[1,47.59],[2,47.753],[3,48.174],[4,48.351],[5,48.527]]},{"speaker":"arjun","en":"Wait… did you hear that?","vi":"Khoan… cậu có nghe thấy gì không?","ipa":["weɪt","dɪd","ju","hiɹ","ðæt"],"start":49.814,"end":51.504,"expression":"surprised","prop":"book","timing":[[0,49.814],[1,50.699],[2,50.89],[3,50.998],[4,51.256]]},{"speaker":"arjun","en":"Something's moving in there! I'm not scared. I'm just… very careful.","vi":"Có gì đang động đậy trong đó! Tớ không sợ đâu. Tớ chỉ… rất cẩn thận thôi.","ipa":["ˈsʌmθɪŋz","ˈmuvɪŋ","ɪn","ðɛɹ","aɪm","nɑt","skɛɹd","aɪm","dʒʌst","ˈvɛɹi","ˈkɛɹfəl"],"start":52.044,"end":56.844,"expression":"worried","react":{"zoe":"happy"},"timing":[[0,52.0